                  </p>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="seo-metric-card group bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/15 hover:border-white/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1"
                >
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                    <div
                      class="w-10 h-10 bg-yellow-500/20 border border-yellow-400/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center"
                    >
                      <svg
                        class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                      >
                        <path
                          stroke-linecap="round"
                          stroke-linejoin="round"
                          stroke-width="2"
                          d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
                        ></path>
                      </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span
                      class="text-xs font-bold text-yellow-400 bg-yellow-400/10 border border-yellow-400/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"
                      >CONVERSION</span
                    >
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-1">
                    <span
                      id="conversion-counter"
                      aria-label="3 Komma 2 fache Conversion-Rate Verbesserung"
                      >0</span
                    >x
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 font-medium">Mehr Anfragen</p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">
                    durch Conversion-Optimierung
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div
                  class="seo-metric-card group bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/15 hover:border-white/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1"
                >
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                    <div
                      class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-400/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center"
                    >
                      <svg
                        class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-400"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                      >
                        <path
                          stroke-linecap="round"
                          stroke-linejoin="round"
                          stroke-width="2"
                          d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
                      </svg>
                    </div>
                    <span
                      class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 bg-blue-400/10 border border-blue-400/20 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"
                      >PAGESPEED</span
                    >
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-1">
                    <span id="speed-counter" aria-label="94 PageSpeed Score"
                      >0</span
                    >
                  </div>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 font-medium">
                    PageSpeed Score
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Core Web Vitals grün</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div
                class="mt-4 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/20"
              >
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="relative flex-shrink-0">
                      <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-400 rounded-full"></div>
                      <div
                        class="absolute inset-0 w-3 h-3 bg-green-400 rounded-full animate-ping opacity-75"
                      >
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300">
                      <span id="active-audits" class="font-bold text-white"
                        >3</span
                      > aktive SEO-Audits laufen gerade
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <svg
                    class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-400 animate-spin flex-shrink-0"
